          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "VIBRANCE\n\nThe Vibrance effect allows you to increase and decrease the amount of \"vibrance\" in your image.\nThe effect amplifies less saturated colors while maintaining saturated colors.\nIn contrast to the Saturation effect, the Vibrance effect will be less destructive to skin tones and is therefore frequently used in TV and photography production."
          }
        },
